      "time": "~20s",
      "narrative": "Caldova has now come full circle.\n\nBefore this, the team had very little visibility across a sea of contracts and invoices. They knew issues were in there. They just could not see where to start.\n\nNow they have one place to see what matched, what needs review, and where overpayment risk may exist.\n\nThis is Caldova's invoice assurance app.",
      "demo_actions": "Open the Waypoint invoices tab. Show a list of invoices with visible statuses: matched, variance, and disputed. Pause on the totals and counts at the top.",
      "screenshot": ".cutready/screenshots/20260617_111154_CleanShot 2026-06-17 at 11.11.27@2x.png"
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~25s",
      "narrative": "Let’s dig deeper. \n\nHere’s an invoice that that matched cleanly. \n\nThe point isn't that the invoice arrived — it's that the app can show why it should be paid, with the exact evidence behind the decision. \n",
      "demo_actions": "Open a matched invoice. Walk through invoice lines, contract terms, PO or receipt context, batch records, QA release, milestone status, and approval history.",
      "screenshot": ".cutready/screenshots/20260617_111259_CleanShot 2026-06-17 at 11.12.21@2x.png"
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~35s",
      "narrative": "Now let's open one that needs attention.\n\nThe app flags a likely overpayment and ties it back to the source records and evidence.\n\nAnd this confidence score is not an auto-approve number. It tells the reviewer where to dig in first, then validate the issue with the supporting details.",
      "demo_actions": "Open a variance or disputed invoice. Highlight the specific mismatch, such as rate, quantity, milestone, timing, or release status. Show linked evidence and the system's decision rationale.",
      "screenshot": ".cutready/screenshots/20260617_111347_CleanShot 2026-06-17 at 11.13.26@2x.png"
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~20s",
      "narrative": "With that evidence trail, the rollup is what matters — because this is about dollars, not just flags. \n\nWhat's ready to pay, what needs review, and where risk is starting to build. \n",
      "demo_actions": "Return to the invoice list. Point to dollar amounts tied to matched, variance, and disputed invoices. Sort or filter to surface the highest-value exceptions.",
      "screenshot": ".cutready/screenshots/20260617_111253_CleanShot 2026-06-17 at 11.11.27@2x.png"
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~25s",
      "narrative": "And it scales past one invoice at a time. The app runs the same checks across the full set. \n\nEvery invoice is held to the same standard, every decision tied to the same evidence chain. \n",
      "demo_actions": "Kick off a batch reconciliation, or return to a completed run. Show the enabled IQs and the progress or result summary.",
      "screenshot": ".cutready/screenshots/20260617_111427_CleanShot 2026-06-17 at 11.14.06@2x.png"
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
