        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~30s",
      "narrative": "In one place, the business can see what is ready to pay, what is blocked, and where to investigate first.\n\nBefore, Caldova had almost no visibility across these contracts and invoices. Now it has a clear map of where risk and overpayment may exist, with evidence attached.\n\nAnd the key point is that a person still makes the call. The app helps the team focus fast, validate the evidence, and act with confidence.\n\nFrom a local prototype to Foundry to production, this is the same platform carrying the work end to end.\n\nThat is how Caldova reviews invoices with more speed, better control, and a stronger business outcome.",
      "demo_actions": "Return to the invoice list or batch results. Highlight final decisions, linked evidence, and any audit or review history. Land on the strongest summary view and pause there as the close.",
      "screenshot": ".cutready/screenshots/20260617_111509_CleanShot 2026-06-17 at 11.14.49@2x.png"
    }
  ],
